        "original_id": "01f909db-d8a4-5cc2-ba67-14bc473494d3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Hives, Broder Daniel, The Plan\n- Albums: Barely Legal\n- People: Theodor Jensen\n- Places: Sweden, Gothenburg, Fagersta\n- Topics: Swedish rock, garage rock revival\n\nFacts:\n- Broder Daniel was an alternative rock band from Gothenburg, Sweden.\n- In 2000, The Plan was formed by Theodor Jensen, who had been a guitarist and later a bass player in Broder Daniel.\n- The Hives are a Swedish rock band that rose to prominence in the early 2000s during the garage rock revival.\n- Barely Legal is the debut studio album by The Hives, a Swedish rock band from Fagersta, Sweden.",
